{title: Aankhon Hi Aankhon Me Ishara}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Geeta Dutt O P Nayyar}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A],        Ankhon Hi Ankhon Hi Mein
[E] [D],        Ishara Ho Gaya
[D] [A],        Baithe Baithe Jine Ka
[E] [A],        Sahara Ho Gaya
[A] [E] [A],        Gate Ho Git Kyu Dil Pe Kyu Hath Hai
[A] [E] [A],        Khoe Ho Kis Liye, Aisi Kya Bat Hai
[A] [E] [A],        Ye Hal Kab Se Tumhara Ho Gaya
[A],        Ankhon Hi Ankhon Hi....
[A] [E] [A],        Chalate Ho Jhum Ke Badali Hai Chal Bhi
[A] [E] [A],        Naino Me Rang Hai Bikhare Hai Bal Bhi
[A] [E] [A],        Kis Dilaruba Ka Nazara Ho Gaya
[A],        Ankhon Hi ...
[A] [E] [A],        Ab Na Vo Zor Hai, Ab Na Vo Shor Hai
[A] [E] [A],        Hamko Hai Sab Pata Dil me Kya Chor Hai
[A] [E] [A],        Ye Chor Kab Se Gavara Ho Gaya
[A],        Ankhon Hi Ankhon Hi
